{"version":1,"key":"quest:60","content":{"id":60,"title":"什么是 JWT？JWT 是如何工作的？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:60","type":"quest","id":60},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"JWT 身份验证与信息交换机制","meta":"","excerpt":"JWT 全称 JSON Web Token，是一种开放标准（RFC 7519），用以在各方通过 JSON 来安全地进行身份验证和信息交换。 身份验证：可以把 JWT 看作是门禁卡，在需要验证的地方，只要出示此门禁卡仅可，签名验证通过后，即可提取出携带的信息，而不用查询数据库，速度快信息交换，在不可信的环境中，为防止被篡","target":{"key":"card:669","type":"card","id":669},"citeKey":"card:669"}],"trail":[{"time":1745921793277,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1768722818979,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1768722818988,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1745921793277,"updateTime":1745921793277,"resolvedTime":1768722818988},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1745921793277}}